# Environment files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Only the production auth domain, nothing secret.
!.env.production
# Emulator-only dummy values (demo-barbershop).
!.env.emulator
# Each shop's config: its Firebase web config (public by design), name and site address. Its
# .env.local (App Check debug token) stays ignored by *.local above.
!shops/*/.env

# Written by `npm run deploy -- <shop>` for the deploy, then deleted.
firebase.*.json

# Admin service account keys belong outside the project (docs/ARCHITECTURE.md, 9.1).
# Ignored here anyway, in case one is saved in the wrong place.
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
*service-account*.json
*serviceAccount*.json
firebase-keys/

